    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
  </metadata>

  <prompt>Build useSprkMemoRepository hook at src/solutions/Notepad/src/hooks/useSprkMemoRepository.ts per FR-14/15/17 (REVISED post task 001). Provides list + create + update against sprk_memo via Xrm.WebApi. **List**: filter by entity-specific lookup for regardingEntity per SUPPORTED_MEMO_PARENTS map (e.g. `_sprk_regardingmatter_value eq {guid}` for Matter); $select includes sprk_memoid, sprk_name, sprk_memobody, sprk_regardingrecordid, createdby, createdon, modifiedon; $orderby createdon desc. **Create**: MUST use `PolymorphicResolverService.applyResolverFields()` from @spaarke/ui-components (populates entity-specific lookup + all 4 resolver fields in one call); MUST include sprk_name = "Untitled" (NOT NULL); nav-props discovered via ManyToOneRelationships metadata. **Update**: sprk_memobody (body) + optionally sprk_name (title). Debounced update per FR-17. If regardingEntity is NOT in SUPPORTED_MEMO_PARENTS, return { unsupported: true, ...defaults } so UI can show error. **See notes/design-alignment-corrections.md.**</prompt>

  <role>Spaarke platform developer. Xrm.WebApi CRUD + React hooks + debounce patterns.</role>

  <goal>useSprkMemoRepository.ts + tests; supports list/create/update; 1s debounce on update; immediate save on Ctrl+Enter / blur triggers.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Design §3.6 — hook centralizing sprk_memo CRUD. Initially lives inside Notepad (extraction to shared lib deferred until second consumer per §3.6). Adapt CRUD calls from MemoSection.tsx.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file>src/solutions/Notepad/src/hooks/useSprkMemoRepository.ts</file>
      <file>src/solutions/Notepad/src/hooks/__tests__/useSprkMemoRepository.test.ts</file>
      <file>src/solutions/EventDetailSidePane/src/components/MemoSection.tsx</file>
      <file>projects/record-header-and-notepad-r1/notes/sprk-memo-schema.md</file>
    </relevant-files>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-028">Xrm.WebApi only; no BFF; no @spaarke/auth.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-024">sprk_memo uses text field sprk_regardingrecordid (Path A exception).</constraint>
    <constraint source="spec">FR-14: list order createdon desc.</constraint>
    <constraint source="spec">FR-15: create with sprk_regardingrecordid=regardingId, empty body.</constraint>
    <constraint source="spec">FR-17: save on Ctrl+Enter (immediate), on blur (immediate), on 1s idle typing (debounced).</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <files>
